- open_dense→finite_codim: FAILS (U = complement of a fat Cantor set: open dense, complement is a Cantor set, not a manifold). Wait: complement of fat Cantor set in [0,1] is open and dense; is it open dense? Fat Cantor set is closed nowhere dense, so complement is open dense. Yes. Its complement isn't a finite-codim submanifold. So fails.
- open_dense→measure: FAILS (U = complement of fat Cantor set has measure < 1).
